Shortest Path
-------------
https://github.com/Skretzo/shortest-path by Skretzo and contributors

Farm Run Optimizer has no walking line of its own. When both plugins are installed and the
setting is on, it sends Shortest Path each stop (the patch or the gardener's spot) through RuneLite's
plugin messages, and Shortest Path draws the line.
The fairy ring travel log highlight follows how Shortest Path does it (PathAnnotator); it was
written anew here, not copied.

