Shortest Path's spirit-tree-patches.tsv; calquat tiles were checked against Quest Helper's tree run.

Romte1
------
https://github.com/Romte1

The Farm run bank button, FarmBankButton.java (the button in the bank's title bar that opens the
Farm run view) and FarmBankButtonOverlay.java (its animation: a gold sheen, green halo, ring of
leaves and fireflies), is Romte1's code from his pull request #1 to this repository, used with his
permission. Small changes: it opens this plugin's own run tag, uses this plugin's setting, and
reports where it is for the "Not in your bank" box. The Now / next box and spacing out the bank
tag's items (RunBankLayout.java) follow ideas from the same pull request; that code was written
separately here.

Quest Helper
------------
https://github.com/Zoinkwiz/quest-helper

The built-in patch tiles in FarmPatch.java were checked against the patch locations in Quest
Helper's herb run and tree run helpers. Only map coordinates (facts about the game) were used; no
code was copied.
